 "amendments": {
  "items": {
   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of the\ncity of Yonkers",
    "basePrintNo": "S400",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S400-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S400\n\nSPONSOR: STEWART-COUSINS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of\nthe city of Yonkers\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nExtender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on serial\nbonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2023 to June 30, 2024.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection one extends the City of Yonkers' authorization to issue bonds\nand notes through negotiated sale to June 30, 2024.\n\nSection two is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nExtender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on serial\nbonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2023 to June 30, 2024, The authori-\nzation for Yonkers to negotiate the private sales of its bonds or notes\nis vital to improving the city's financial stability and independence.\nThe city's bonding authority will expire on June 30, 2022 unless it is\nextended for one year. The continuation of this power will allow more\ncost-effective financing for the city of Yonkers.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2022 - S8387 Chapter 332\n\n2021 - S1033 Chapter 168\n\n2020 - S7508B Chapter 58\n\n2019 - S3405 Chapter 71\n\n2018 - S7352 Chapter 81\n\n2017 - S6720 Chapter 44\n\n2016 - S6355 Chapter 45\n\n2015 - S3463 Chapter 21\n\n2014 - S6313 Chapter 70\n\n2013 - S3020 Chapter 69\n\n2012 - S6460 Chapter 72\n\n2011 - S2982 Chapter 66\n\n2010 - S6720 Chapter 125\n\n2009 - S3336 Chapter 77\n2008 - S6878 Chapter 144\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
